      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790360634820,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Redhat - OpenShift\n    - Commercial on-prem kubernetes\n    - has some cool extensions, etc.\n    - but you PAY a bunch\n        - in exchange - you get SLA, support, etc.\n",
