      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Redhat - OpenShift\n    - Commercial on-prem kubernetes\n    - has some cool extensions, etc.\n    - but you PAY a bunch\n        - in exchange - you get SLA, support, etc.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
