      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790361123108,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deployment\n    - A Pod\n        - one or more containers that will\n          run together on the same node\n    - replicas\n        - how many copies of this pod do you need?\n    - it will also register with the kubelet service.",
